  "brain_first": "“有词先看它要怎么变；没词先看这里缺哪类小词。”",
  "sort_order": 1049,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2068
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "10个空中，有些括号给原词，有些完全空白。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2069
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2070
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Provided-word blanks 常考形式变化；no-word",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2071
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "blanks 常考功能词。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2072
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “有词先看它要怎么变；没词先看这里缺哪类小词。”",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2073
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 先分类可以避免看到空就随机猜语法。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2074
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2075
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先给每个空标 P（provided）或 N（no word）。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2076
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 P：看括号词性，问句中需要动词/名词/形容词/副词/代词哪一种。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2077
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 N：看空前后结构，优先检查冠词、介词、连词/关系词、代词。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2078
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 做完统一检查拼写、大小写、单复数和时态。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2079
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2080
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2081
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2082
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 括号是动词 → 先谓语/非谓语",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2083
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 括号是形容词 → 可能变副词/比较级/名词",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2084
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 完全没词且后面是名词 → 冠词/限定词/介词可能性高",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2085
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 每个空先归入正确的大类。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2086
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 完全不知道时先判断“需要实词变化还是功能小词”，不要直接猜单词。",
      "sourcePage": 75,
      "sourceIndex": 2087
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2088
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The event was ___ (success) organized. 给了 success，空修饰 organized，需要副词 successfully。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2089
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2090
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看到词就只改一个字母。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2091
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 没词时随便填介词。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2092
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2093
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 给词/不给词分类对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2094
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 句中需要的词性是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2095
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2096
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2097
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2098
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 先分类，再语法。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2099
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 看到空第一问？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 有提示词 develop，进入哪条路？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 无提示词且名词前缺限定，可能？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 无提示词连接两句，可能？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 先猜语法名还是先看结构？",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 给词了吗？；2. 有提示词→先判断词性/动词结构。；3. 冠词/代词等。；4. 连词/关系词。；5. 先看结",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "构和空需要什么。",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 76,
      "sourceIndex": 2109
    }
  ],
